{"version":1,"content":"<p>香港的美食版圖向來熱鬧，而最叫一眾饕客興奮的，莫過於各大名廚之間激發的美味火花。</p><p>近期本地餐飲界迎來多場重量級的聯乘盛宴，本地大廚和來自韓國及其他國家的名家聯手合作，由韓國菜、日本菜至甜點通通都有，強強聯手，滋味更吸引。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:25:31.868552+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:00:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:19:38.392696+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T06:19:38.392696+00:00","content_hash":"107abd2bf687a22bf6679c9f33d41cdcdcdb2bb4304c5b061e484c3692f118e9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}